---
title: "Cyberpunk creator"
note: "A character of a neon city for Krea 2: one of thirty roles (netrunner, mercenary, street doctor, courier, fixer, corporate agent, nomad, pop idol, ripperdoc …), each with its working clothes and its gear, or street fashion instead; visible chrome, two pieces for the heavily augmented; hair in a neon dye, a gang's colours and sign now and then, a drone or a cyber-rat beside them. It keeps what the picture cannot show (EXPORT:): the role, the gang, the augments, the gear, a mood, a quirk, two skills, a voice, so a reel that casts it from the gallery reads $hero.role and $hero.gang. One seed is one character, from four sides by the grid; $backdrop puts it in the night city instead of the studio, $view one side only to try characters faster."
tags: [krea, characters, references, cyberpunk]
---
$colour = __characters/creator/colour__
$gender = {woman:4|man:4|nonbinary person}
$fit = {IF $gender is woman: women|{IF $gender is man: men|all}}
$age = {young:4|prime:3|middle-aged:2|old}
$years = {IF $age is young: {19-26}|{IF $age is prime: {27-39}|{IF $age is middle-aged: {40-58}|{59-79}}}}
$origin = __characters/creator/origin__
$build = __characters/creator/build__
$face = __characters/creator/face__
$eyes = __characters/creator/eyes__
$haircolour = {IF $age is old: {silver|white|iron-grey}|{__characters/cyberpunk/dye__:3|__characters/creator/haircolour__:2|$colour}}
$hair = __characters/creator/hair[fit=$fit|all]__
$beard = {IF $gender is man: {__characters/creator/beard__|none:2}|none}
$mark = __characters/creator/mark__
$role = __characters/cyberpunk/role__
$chrome = {IF $role.chrome is heavy: {2$$__characters/cyberpunk/implant__}|__characters/cyberpunk/implant__}
$outfit = {$role.wear:3|__characters/cyberpunk/streetwear[fit=$fit|all]__:2}
$gear = $role.gear
$gang = {__characters/cyberpunk/gang__:2|none:3}
$motif = __characters/creator/motif[genre=cyberpunk|all]__
$companion = {__characters/creator/companion[genre=cyberpunk]__|none:3}
$presence = __characters/creator/presence__
$backdrop = {studio:3|city}
$who = a $years-year-old $gender of $origin: $build, $face, $eyes, $hair{IF $beard is not none: , $beard|} and $mark, with $chrome; $role in $outfit, their clothes marked by $motif{IF $gang is not none: , wearing the $gang.colours of $gang with $gang.sign|}, with $gear{IF $companion is not none: , $companion|}
# What the picture carries beyond its prompt (EXPORT:): a screenplay that casts it reads $hero.who, $hero.role, $hero.gang …
EXPORT:
  who = $who
  age = $years
  $gender
  $role
  gang = $gang
  augments = $chrome
  gear = $gear
  $colour
  mood = __characters/creator/mood__
  quirk = __characters/creator/quirk__
  skills = {2$$__characters/creator/skill[genre=cyberpunk|all]__}
  voice = __characters/creator/voice__
# The grid runs every view: one character from four sides. Set $view to one of them to try characters faster.
$look = {photo:5|animated:2|anime:3}
$view = {portrait|three-quarter|full-length|profile}
$opening = {IF $look is photo: A cinematic photograph, as from a neo-noir science-fiction film,|{IF $look is animated: A 3D character render, in the style of a modern animated feature film,|An anime character design}}
$frame = {IF $view is portrait: A head-and-shoulders portrait, facing the camera|{IF $view is three-quarter: A head-and-shoulders view turned three-quarters to the left|{IF $view is full-length: A full-length view of the whole body, from the top of the head to the shoes, with floor and space around it in frame, standing straight with the arms relaxed, facing the camera|A strict side profile of the head and shoulders: the face seen exactly from the side, turned 90 degrees to the left, the nose pointing at the left edge of the frame and only one eye visible}}}
$finish = {IF $look is photo: Shot on an 85mm lens at eye level, true colours with a touch of neon in the highlights.|{IF $look is animated: Stylised proportions, soft subsurface skin.|Clean line art and flat cel shading.}}
$opening of $who, with $presence. $frame, against {IF $backdrop is studio: a seamless mid-grey studio backdrop|__characters/cyberpunk/city__}, in soft, even light. $finish
@size 832x1216
@grid $view
